(text "J1 and J2: 1=SCL, 2=SDA, 3=3V3, 4=GND.\nBoth connectors are wired in parallel, pin for pin.\nR1/R2: one shared pair of 4.7k pull-ups.\nLED indicates 3.3V power, not I2C traffic.\nTwo M2.5 mounting holes, 2.7mm NPTH." (at 25 140 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c42eafaf-fdb7-5624-a722-882fb5b7922b"))
